        },
        {
          "text": "Covering for the feet and lower part of the legs; a stocking or stockings.",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        },
        {
          "text": "A flexible pipe, made of leather, India rubber, or other material, and used for conveying fluids, especially water, from a faucet, hydrant, or fire engine. Hose carriage, cart, or truck, a wheeled vehicle fitted for conveying hose for extinguishing fires. in the extinguishing of fires. [U.S.] -- Hose coupling, coupling with interlocking parts for uniting hose, end to end. disconnect them.",
